### 📌 Adım 1: Ubuntu Üzerine ROS 2 Humble Kurulumu

*(İşletim sisteminiz Ubuntu 22.04 LTS olmalıdır).*

1. **Sistem Dil / Locale Ayarlarını Yapın:**
   ```bash
   sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y locale
   sudo locale-gen en_US en_US.UTF-8
   sudo update-locale LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8 LANG=en_US.UTF-8
   export LANG=en_US.UTF-8
   ```

2. **ROS 2 Depolarını Ekleyin:**
   ```bash
   sudo apt install -y software-properties-common curl
   sudo add-apt-repository universe
   sudo curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros/rosdistro/master/ros.key -o /usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg
   echo "deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg] http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu $(. /etc/os-release && echo $UBUNTU_CODENAME) main" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ros2.list > /dev/null
   ```

3. **ROS 2 Paketlerini ve Gerekli Kütüphaneleri Yükleyin:**
   ```bash
   sudo apt update
   sudo apt install -y ros-humble-ros-base python3-colcon-common-extensions python3-rosdep python3-pip python3-opencv ros-humble-cv-bridge ros-humble-sensor-msgs ros-humble-geometry-msgs ros-humble-std-msgs ros-humble-nav-msgs ros-humble-mavros ros-humble-mavros-extras git cmake build-essential
   ```

4. **ROS 2 Ortam Değişkenini Bash'e Ekleyin:**
   ```bash
   echo "source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash" >> ~/.bashrc
   source ~/.bashrc
   ```

